var: Stands for "Variable".

Purpose: Variable data files.

Content: Logs, mail, spools, caches.

LPIC1: Know it holds changing system data.

log: System and application log files.

cache: Application cache data.

spool: Printer and mail job queues.

mail: User mailbox storage.

lock: Lock files for resources.

tmp: Temporary variable files.

lib: Variable state information.

run: Runtime variable data.